HDSatelit Image
===============

HDSatelit Image is a version of the enigma2 set-top box software derived
under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (see LICENSE.GPLv2).

Origin and permission
---------------------
This source tree starts from the enigma2 source code published by Dream
Multimedia, at the state of 14 September 2011 (git commit
75d5fba59f4e575eab24d1a6397a5904abed1101). The original license of that
version is kept unchanged in LICENSE.original-2011. It states:

  "You are free to take *THIS* version of enigma2, and derive a version
   which will be licensed under the GPLv2. If you're doing this, be sure
   to insert proper licencening statements to ensure that it doesn't get
   mixed up with the proprietary version."

HDSatelit Image is such a derived version. It is licensed under the GPLv2
only, and it is NOT the proprietary version of Dream Multimedia. No code
from Dream Multimedia released after this date, or under any later license,
is used.

Files not covered
-----------------
The original license excluded plugins in lib/python/Plugins that carry
their own LICENSE file. Plugins licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 and fonts without a license that
allows redistribution are removed from this tree. The list is in
doc/REMOVED-FILES.

